Found while working k348 (state worker). Not fixed, line numbers are in the k348-patched tree.

- lib/OCP/Corefile.pm:57: imports are expanded only at the top level, so *.override snippets inside the root block are not read. A second hosts plugin there would crash CoreDNS, and neither the writer nor the probe notices.
